  "message.factoryworks.welcome": "\u00a76\u00a7lWelcome to FactoryWorks!\n\u00a77\u00a7oFactorio's progression in Minecraft: mine, smelt, research and automate, then take the factory to other planets.\n\u00a7bYou have crash-landed on Terra with a few tools and some salvage. Build a factory from nothing and launch a rocket off this planet.\n\u00a7e\u00bb There is no crafting table here: your inventory is the Personal Assembler. Open it to craft.\n\u00a7e\u00bb You place blocks and pick up buildings from 16 blocks away, but you dig terrain, ore and trees only up close.\n\u00a7e\u00bb Your first steps are in the quest book in your inventory: hover over it.",
